    {
      "Seq": 11,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I find myself among the tide pools, a shelf of rock pitted with pools the tide leaves full, each a small world. Around me are marks of alleys, exits marked, a sand flat, a thicket of bramble, a crab, a pool, and a rocky shore. I notice a sound, the alley's racing between the shore and the rock, waves running through it and cold rising from below.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 12,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I mark the sun-warmed slab of rock above the tideline. Dry and warm on its landward side, it beckons. I will rely on my skills to survive here, choosing each step with care.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 13,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I failed to heed the flat rock, lost the thread of thoughts, starved before night.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 15,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I watch the water's edge, recalling how I once hid from looters, the salty breeze reminding me of those times spent by the port. I let my focus go, where once I'd watch for scraps on the street.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 16,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I mark the rock's edge, the salt-bright pool, and the anemones at the bottom. My intent is to examine closely, to stay alive here, to trust only the practical skill of this place.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 17,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I search the pool for food, not to stand and stare. Finds what keeps me, not what tastes nice.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 18,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Tide Pool Zone",
      "LocationId": 26448,
      "Actor": "Aentonyuz the Wild",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I won't delve into the tide pool's secrets. That would be foolish, and I'll think on it again. I could seize a crab here. I'll use the street's harsh conditions to stay alive, marking the safe alleyways.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 0,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 19,
      "Kind": 0,
